@startuml
' M8.3 - Canonical implementation class diagram
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title Dynamic Price Optimizer - Implementation Class Diagram

package "Data Ingestion" {
  class MultiSourceIngestion {
    +find_file_in_dir()
    +build_macro_lookup()
    +harmonize_marketplace_corpus()
    +build_harmonized_marketplace_records()
    +export_harmonized_records_parquet()
  }
}

package "Feature Engineering" {
  class TextFeatureReducer {
    +fit_transform(texts)
    +transform(texts)
    +save_artifacts()
    +load_artifacts()
  }

  class ContinuousMetadataNormalizer {
    +build_live_metadata_vector()
    +fit_transform(records)
    +transform(records)
    +save_artifacts()
    +load_artifacts()
  }

  class CoordinateFusion {
    +fuse_coordinates(text, metadata)
    +fuse_coordinate_batches(text, metadata)
  }

  class LeakageSafeMetadataEnricher {
    +fit(training_frame)
    +transform(frame, groups)
    +save_artifacts()
    +load_artifacts()
  }
}

package "Spatial Pricing" {
  class DomainPartitionedKDTreeIndexer {
    +fit(vectors, partitions, verified_rates)
    +query(vector, partition, k)
    +predict_base_rate(vector, partition, k)
    +save_artifacts()
    +load_artifacts()
  }
}

package "Financial Rules" {
  class MpesaTariffEvaluator {
    +compute_surcharge(base_rate, mentor_country)
    +evaluate_quote(base_rate, mentor_country)
    +from_csv()
  }
}

package "Training and Evaluation" {
  class TrainingPipeline {
    +load_harmonized_parquet()
    +build_stratified_splits()
    +orchestrate_training()
    +evaluate_and_serialize_training()
  }

  class ExperimentReporting {
    +run_experiment_report()
    +run_feature_ablation_report()
    +run_text_representation_report()
    +run_validation_diagnostics()
  }
}

package "API Contracts and Service" {
  class PricingQueryDTO
  class PeerMatchDTO
  class PredictionResultDTO
  class HealthResponseDTO
  class InferenceRuntime
  class FastAPIService {
    +GET /health
    +POST /api/v1/optimize-price
  }
}

MultiSourceIngestion --> TextFeatureReducer : raw descriptions
MultiSourceIngestion --> ContinuousMetadataNormalizer : macro features
TextFeatureReducer --> CoordinateFusion : 50-D text
ContinuousMetadataNormalizer --> CoordinateFusion : 3-D metadata
LeakageSafeMetadataEnricher --> CoordinateFusion : offline ablations
CoordinateFusion --> DomainPartitionedKDTreeIndexer : 53-D production vector
DomainPartitionedKDTreeIndexer --> MpesaTariffEvaluator : base quote
TrainingPipeline --> TextFeatureReducer : fit on train only
TrainingPipeline --> ContinuousMetadataNormalizer : fit on train only
TrainingPipeline --> DomainPartitionedKDTreeIndexer : serialize artifacts
ExperimentReporting --> TrainingPipeline : evaluate frozen splits
FastAPIService --> PricingQueryDTO : validates request
FastAPIService --> InferenceRuntime : startup/load state
InferenceRuntime --> TextFeatureReducer
InferenceRuntime --> ContinuousMetadataNormalizer
InferenceRuntime --> DomainPartitionedKDTreeIndexer
InferenceRuntime --> MpesaTariffEvaluator
FastAPIService --> PredictionResultDTO : returns response
FastAPIService --> HealthResponseDTO : readiness

note right of DomainPartitionedKDTreeIndexer
Production model scope:
partitioned KNN/IDW with peer
explainability payloads.
end note

@enduml

